us":6},"id":"impact-decision-1","slots":{"content":[{"config":{"text":{"$i18n":"history.restore.impact.item.decision.pending"},"tone":"default","value":"Should guests see the saved-address picker?","value2":"Checkout","variant":"label"},"id":"impact-decision-1-text","type":"Text"}]},"type":"Stack"},{"config":{"card":true,"direction":"vertical","padding":"6px 8px","radius":6},"id":"impact-decision-2","slots":{"content":[{"config":{"text":{"$i18n":"history.restore.impact.item.decision.decided"},"tone":"default","value":"Is the order summary open by default?","value2":"Checkout","variant":"label"},"id":"impact-decision-2-text","type":"Text"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"},{"config":{"direction":"horizontal","gap":8,"justify":"end","padding":"4px 0 0","wrap":true},"id":"impact-footer","slots":{"content":[{"config":{"label":{"$i18n":"common.cancel"},"variant":"outline"},"id":"impact-footer-cancel","type":"Button"},{"config":{"icon":"trash-2","label":{"$i18n":"deleteResource.impact.confirm"},"variant":"danger"},"id":"impact-footer-confirm","type":"Button"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Panel"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"RootShell"},"name":"Delete: View and UX Flow dialogs","spec":{"accessibility":["Focus starts on Cancel, the safe choice; each stage moves focus to its own text so it is read out; the impact count is read before the list."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Stack, Text, Button, Panel dialog); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","The strings of the app are copied under the same Locale keys; a sentence with up to three names binds them through value, value2 and value3, the names, ids and the Decision questions are sample content.","The two stages are two dialogs shown one at a time by a Variant; the reading, conflict, locked and refused states of this dialog are those of the Assets: Delete dialog and are not repeated here. The dialog is a Panel with a shadow over the page, not a dimmed Workbench behind a Modal.","Every visible string is bound with $i18n except identities (names, ids); en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A member pressed Delete… in the header of a View page (or in the UX Flow editor) while holding the key to delete it; the dialog opens over the page and focus starts on Cancel.","The base state is the confirmation to delete the View Checkout; the Variant delete-flow is the one for a UX Flow, and view-impact the second dialog a View that other resources refer to asks for.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the dialog is Workbench chrome and follows the Workbench language, so its text is baked here per Locale. The names are sample content."],"intent":"Show the Delete dialogs of a View and of a UX Flow as built from Adapter Widgets only: the confirmation that says what is removed and that nothing which refers to it is changed, and, for a View that others refer to, the list of what would be left pointing at nothing, asked to be acknowledged before anything is deleted.","interactionRules":["Delete removes the View with its Spec and its Decisions, or the UX Flow, and nothing else: no Review thread, Flow step or reference that names it is changed, and earlier versions stay in History, where it can be restored.","When others refer to the View, the first request deletes nothing and the dialog becomes \"Delete anyway?\": it counts the effects and lists them by group, the Review threads anchored in the View, the References to it, the UX Flow steps that target it and each of its Decisions, whatever their status.","Only the explicit Delete anyway deletes, with the impact acknowledged; Cancel, the close button and Esc leave everything as it was."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"sibling","type":"view","viewId":"d8e4c204-6f70-4182-9d94-afb0c1d2e306"}],"requirements":[]},"variants":{"delete-flow":{"state":{"flow-wrap":{"visible":true},"view-wrap":{"visible":false}}},"view-impact":{"requirements":["01a1144e-50dd-7b92-aa5e-e175e34bf424","01a172ce-280b-7cec-9ca5-ec189b313ebe","01a172ce-31eb-7b81-afd6-ddd6855cc30e"],"state":{"impact-wrap":{"visible":true},"view-wrap":{"visible":false}}}}}
